<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Kalavad 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does car transportation from Kalavad to major hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit time for a car shipped from Kalavad to major transport hubs, such as Mumbai or Delhi, usually ranges from 2 to 4 days depending on traffic, weather, and the specific route chosen. Our dedicated multi‑axle express freight highways and real‑time GPS monitoring help minimize delays, ensuring your vehicle arrives within the promised window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for vehicle transport in train versus road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For road transport, you need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed transport agreement, and an e‑Way bill generated under GST. If you opt for rail carriage, the same documents are required plus a railway consignment note (CN) and, where applicable, a railway cargo reservation form. All paperwork is handled by our team to ensure compliance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a guarantee against scratches during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers offers a Zero‑Scratch Guarantee on every car transportation in Kalavad. Our hydraulic ramp trailers feature anti‑vibration mounts, and each vehicle is wrapped in our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging. In the unlikely event of damage, the IRDAI‑approved marine insurance covers full repair costs, and we coordinate the claim on your behalf.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I track my car delivery status in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS device that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Once your car is loaded, you’ll receive a unique tracking ID. Simply log in to the portal or use the mobile app to view step‑by‑step updates, estimated arrival time, and any checkpoint photos.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
